  ($qb$HEAIL-ACC-FIB-013$qb$, $qb$A6-01$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Saying you do not know is more useful than an answer nobody can ______.$qb$, $qb$rely$qb$, $qb$file$qb$, $qb$hear$qb$, $qb$repeat$qb$, $qb$close$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-ACC-FIB-014$qb$, $qb$A6-01$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Ownership of a job does not end when your part is done but when the whole thing ______.$qb$, $qb$works$qb$, $qb$starts$qb$, $qb$changes$qb$, $qb$appears$qb$, $qb$opens$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
