  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-FIB-007$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Notes taken during training are worth little unless they are used within a ______.$qb$, $qb$week$qb$, $qb$year$qb$, $qb$team$qb$, $qb$project$qb$, $qb$job$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-FIB-008$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$A mistake understood is worth more than a mistake simply ______.$qb$, $qb$avoided$qb$, $qb$recorded$qb$, $qb$reported$qb$, $qb$forgiven$qb$, $qb$repeated$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-FIB-009$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Watching someone expert do a task slowly teaches more than watching them do it ______.$qb$, $qb$quickly$qb$, $qb$twice$qb$, $qb$alone$qb$, $qb$silently$qb$, $qb$badly$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-FIB-010$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$The gap between knowing about something and being able to do it is closed by ______.$qb$, $qb$practice$qb$, $qb$reading$qb$, $qb$listening$qb$, $qb$planning$qb$, $qb$discussion$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
