  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-MCQ-028$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You have been doing the same job well for eight years. What is most useful to establish?$qb$, $qb$What parts of it you have never examined$qb$, $qb$Whether you still enjoy the work$qb$, $qb$Whether the job is changing around you$qb$, $qb$What other roles you could move into$qb$, $qb$Whether eight years is long enough in one job$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-MCQ-029$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your employer offers training in something not related to your current role. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Ask what the training leads to before deciding$qb$, $qb$Take it, since learning is always worthwhile$qb$, $qb$Take it if you have the time available$qb$, $qb$Ask whether training closer to your role exists$qb$, $qb$Decline it and focus on your current work$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-MCQ-030$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A process at work has always been done a certain way and nobody knows why. What is the most useful response?$qb$, $qb$Find out what it was originally put in to prevent$qb$, $qb$Ask the longest-serving person what they remember$qb$, $qb$Look for anything written down about it$qb$, $qb$Keep following it until someone changes it$qb$, $qb$Change it, since nobody can justify it$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CLC-MCQ-031$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$What is the most useful thing to do immediately after finishing a difficult piece of work?$qb$, $qb$Write down what you would do differently$qb$, $qb$Take a break before starting the next thing$qb$, $qb$Tell your manager it is complete$qb$, $qb$Move on to the next task$qb$, $qb$Review whether the result was good enough$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
