  ($qb$HEAIL-SME-FIB-009$qb$, $qb$A6-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Doing the difficult part first makes the rest of the day feel ______.$qb$, $qb$lighter$qb$, $qb$longer$qb$, $qb$costlier$qb$, $qb$busier$qb$, $qb$quieter$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-SME-FIB-010$qb$, $qb$A6-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Taking initiative without considering whether you have 
